WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.608 --> 00:00:10.166
&gt;&gt; HAVE ANY OF THE 42 ILLEGAL

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:11.308
&gt;&gt; HAVE ANY OF THE 42 ILLEGAL

00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:13.227
MIGRANTS ON THE TERRORIST WATCH

00:00:13.228 --> 00:00:15.337
LIST OR NO FLY LISTEN COUNTERED

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:16.758
AT THE SOUTHWEST BORDER BEEN

00:00:16.769 --> 00:00:17.925
RELEASED INTO THE UNITED STATES

00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:19.815
&gt;&gt; AS I MENTIONED BEFORE I WILL

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:21.231
PROVIDE THAT DATA TO YOU WITH

00:00:21.242 --> 00:00:22.021
RESPECT TO THE DISPOSITION OF

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:22.707
EACH ONE.

00:00:22.741 --> 00:00:24.788
I DO NOT KNOW THE ANSWER TO

00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:25.437
YOUR QUESTION.

00:00:25.448 --> 00:00:27.168
&gt;&gt; THE SECRETARY OF HOMELAND

00:00:27.202 --> 00:00:29.084
SECURITY DOES NOT KNOW THE

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.535
ANSWER TO THE STATUS OF 42

00:00:31.546 --> 00:00:33.409
INDIVIDUALS WHO CAME TO OUR

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.771
SOUTHERN BORDER ILLEGALLY ON

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:36.586
THE NO FLY LIST AND TERRORIST

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:38.279
WATCH LIST AND YOU DO NOT KNOW

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.853
WHETHER THEY HAVE BEEN RELEASED

00:00:39.855 --> 00:00:41.578
OR NOT INTO THE COUNTRY?

00:00:41.589 --> 00:00:42.416
THAT’S YOUR TESTIMONY.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.113
&gt;&gt; RANKING MEMBER JORDAN, AS I

00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:45.169
SAID BEFORE I WILL PROVIDE YOU

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.257
THE DATA.

00:00:46.268 --> 00:00:48.306
&gt;&gt; Bill: THAT WAS A STUNNING

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.008
EXCHANGE RATHER TELLING.

00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:51.995
JIM JORDAN FROM OHIO GRILLING

00:00:51.996 --> 00:00:53.458
THE HOMELAND SECURITY SECRETARY

00:00:53.469 --> 00:00:56.117
MAYORKAS UNABLE TO GIVE BASIC

00:00:56.128 --> 00:00:57.370
INFORMATION DURING A HOUSE

00:00:57.403 --> 00:00:57.828
HEARING.

00:00:57.839 --> 00:00:59.607
NEWT GINGRICH FORMER SPEAKER OF

00:00:59.641 --> 00:01:00.173
THE HOUSE.

00:01:00.184 --> 00:01:01.994
GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:04.282
HE EITHER DID NOT KNOW OR DID

00:01:04.315 --> 00:01:06.144
NOT WANT TO ANSWER.

00:01:06.155 --> 00:01:07.829
WHAT WOULD BE YOUR ANSWER ON

00:01:07.863 --> 00:01:08.744
THAT?

00:01:08.755 --> 00:01:11.767
&gt;&gt; WELL, LOOK, THIS

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.472
ADMINISTRATION HAS FOLLOWED A

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.075
POLICY OF SECRECY AND

00:01:15.076 --> 00:01:16.333
DISHONESTY ON THE BORDER.

00:01:16.335 --> 00:01:17.976
THEY DON’T TELL US WHERE THEY

00:01:17.987 --> 00:01:19.047
ARE SENDING NOW OVER A MILLION

00:01:19.058 --> 00:01:19.433
PEOPLE.

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:22.945
THEY FLY THEM IN LATE AT NIGHT.

00:01:22.956 --> 00:01:24.813
THEY PUT THEM ON TRAINS AND

00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:27.216
BUSES AND THEY LITERALLY REFUSE

00:01:27.227 --> 00:01:28.783
TO TELL PEOPLE WHERE THEY ARE

00:01:28.794 --> 00:01:29.659
GOING.

00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:31.905
THEY ARE TALKING SERIOUSLY

00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:34.219
ABOUT DROPPING THE PUBLIC

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.180
HEALTH REQUIREMENTS, WHICH

00:01:35.191 --> 00:01:36.728
WOULD MEAN 19,000 ILLEGAL

00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:38.200
IMMIGRANTS A DAY IS THE CURRENT

00:01:38.211 --> 00:01:38.903
ESTIMATE.

00:01:38.904 --> 00:01:42.320
THAT’S THE CITY OF ATLANTA

00:01:42.321 --> 00:01:43.611
EVERY MONTH.

00:01:43.622 --> 00:01:45.792
12 ATLANTAS A YEAR IN ILLEGAL

00:01:45.827 --> 00:01:46.668
IMMIGRANTS.

00:01:46.679 --> 00:01:49.001
MAYORKAS IS A COMBINATION OF

00:01:49.012 --> 00:01:50.657
INCOMPETENT AND IMPLEMENTING

00:01:50.668 --> 00:01:53.834
THE POLICIES OF JOE BIDEN.

00:01:53.845 --> 00:01:56.217
BIDEN HAS DECIDED THAT HE WANTS

00:01:56.228 --> 00:01:58.812
AN OPEN BORDER, THAT HE IS

00:01:58.823 --> 00:02:00.133
WILLING TO ACCEPT ANYBODY

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:01.238
WHETHER THEY ARE DISEASED,

00:02:01.249 --> 00:02:02.711
CARRYING FENTANYL OR WHETHER

00:02:02.744 --> 00:02:04.327
THEY HAVE A CRIMINAL RECORD.

00:02:04.338 --> 00:02:05.527
THEY ARE JUST NOT PAYING ANY

00:02:05.561 --> 00:02:05.951
ATTENTION.

00:02:05.962 --> 00:02:08.309
THE BORDER PATROL IS NOW SO

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.530
DROWNING IN THE SHEER NUMBER OF

00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:12.553
PEOPLE THEY CAN’T COMPETE WITH

00:02:12.564 --> 00:02:13.672
THE CARTELS.

00:02:13.706 --> 00:02:15.917
SO WHAT YOU’VE SEEN IS THE

00:02:15.919 --> 00:02:17.100
CARTELS GRADUALLY TAKING

00:02:17.111 --> 00:02:18.992
CONTROL OF THE AMERICAN

00:02:19.003 --> 00:02:19.939
SOUTHERN BORDER.

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:24.613
THE FLOOD OF FENTANYL ALONE.

00:02:24.624 --> 00:02:27.089
I WAS JUST IN COBB COUNTY,

00:02:27.123 --> 00:02:28.223
GEORGIA, WHERE SIX PEOPLE HAVE

00:02:28.224 --> 00:02:29.189
DIED IN THE PREVIOUS TWO WEEKS

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:29.820
FROM FENTANYL.

00:02:29.821 --> 00:02:31.229
AND THIS IS MADNESS.

00:02:31.231 --> 00:02:32.658
AT A MINIMUM KEVIN MCCARTHY IS

00:02:32.669 --> 00:02:33.150
RIGHT.

00:02:33.161 --> 00:02:35.253
MAYORKAS OUGHT TO BE IMPEACHED.

00:02:35.264 --> 00:02:36.955
BUT I THINK ALSO THE WHOLE

00:02:36.988 --> 00:02:38.711
DEPARTMENT HAS TO BE OVERHAULED

00:02:38.722 --> 00:02:41.562
AND THE IDEA THAT THEY AREN’T

00:02:41.573 --> 00:02:43.369
GOING TO APPOINT SOME LEFT WING

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.282
ZEALOT TO BECOME THE CENSORSHIP

00:02:45.317 --> 00:02:46.627
CZAR FOR THE UNITED STATES

00:02:46.638 --> 00:02:47.412
CLEARLY UNCONSTITUTIONAL.

00:02:47.423 --> 00:02:49.290
CLEARLY A VIOLATION OF THE

00:02:49.301 --> 00:02:51.127
FIRST AMENDMENT AND MAYBE A

00:02:51.161 --> 00:02:53.170
TRIBUTE TO JOE BIDEN’S FRIENDS

00:02:53.171 --> 00:02:55.471
IN THE CHINESE COMMUNIST PARTY

00:02:55.482 --> 00:02:56.908
OR MOSCOW.

00:02:56.919 --> 00:02:58.656
BUT CERTAINLY A VERY UNAMERICAN.

00:02:58.667 --> 00:02:59.895
THIS TELLS YOU HOW OUT OF

00:02:59.906 --> 00:03:01.795
CONTROL THEY ARE.

00:03:01.829 --> 00:03:04.306
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE HAVE THE STATISTICS

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:05.807
ABOUT THE MIGRANT ENCOUNTERS SO

00:03:05.841 --> 00:03:06.820
FAR THIS YEAR.

00:03:06.831 --> 00:03:08.137
NUMBERS ARE STAGGERING AND OUT

00:03:08.171 --> 00:03:10.007
THERE FOR EVERYONE TO SEE.

00:03:10.008 --> 00:03:11.457
EARLIER TODAY AS WE WERE

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.303
REPORTING ON THE NEW POLL, BILL

00:03:13.314 --> 00:03:15.573
POINTED OUT THAT IF YOU LOOK AT

00:03:15.584 --> 00:03:16.894
THE BREAKDOWN OF REPUBLICANS

00:03:16.905 --> 00:03:18.074
AND DEMOCRATS, REPUBLICANS

00:03:18.085 --> 00:03:19.396
THINK OF IMMIGRATION AS THEIR

00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:20.693
NUMBER TWO CONCERN AFTER

00:03:20.694 --> 00:03:22.243
INFLATION AND THE ECONOMY.

00:03:22.277 --> 00:03:24.287
BUT FOR DEMOCRATS IT IS WAY

00:03:24.298 --> 00:03:25.553
DOWN THE LIST LIKE NUMBER FIVE

00:03:25.564 --> 00:03:26.942
OR SIX.

00:03:26.976 --> 00:03:30.060
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THAT?

00:03:30.062 --> 00:03:32.630
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK HISTORICALLY

00:03:32.632 --> 00:03:34.122
REPUBLICANS HAVE BEEN MUCH MORE

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:35.075
COMMITTED TO AMERICAN

00:03:35.109 --> 00:03:36.369
PATRIOTISM, TO THE IDEA OF THE

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:36.988
NATION.

00:03:37.021 --> 00:03:40.333
I THINK ON THE LEFT YOU HAVE A

00:03:40.344 --> 00:03:43.043
LARGE BLOCK OF PEOPLE WHO DON’T

00:03:43.077 --> 00:03:44.743
WANT TO STAND FOR THE NATIONAL

00:03:44.754 --> 00:03:45.175
ANTHEM.

00:03:45.209 --> 00:03:47.146
THEY DON’T WANT TO RECOGNIZE

00:03:47.157 --> 00:03:48.347
THE AMERICAN FLAG AS OUR

00:03:48.358 --> 00:03:49.373
PRIMARY SYMBOL.

00:03:49.384 --> 00:03:51.269
THEY DON’T WANT TO TEACH

00:03:51.302 --> 00:03:52.208
AMERICAN HISTORY ACCURATELY.

00:03:52.219 --> 00:03:54.755
AND THEY FRANKLY THINK IT IS

00:03:54.766 --> 00:03:56.570
JUST FINE TO BE DROWNED IN

00:03:56.571 --> 00:03:58.519
PEOPLE WHO DON’T UNDERSTAND

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.067
AMERICA, HAVEN’T LEARNED ABOUT

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:00.936
OUR COUNTRY, HAVEN’T

00:04:00.938 --> 00:04:01.501
ASSIMILATED.

00:04:01.503 --> 00:04:04.428
SO I THINK THERE IS A HUGE

00:04:04.429 --> 00:04:05.312
DIFFERENCE THERE.

00:04:05.323 --> 00:04:06.747
INTERESTINGLY AMONG LATINOS WHO

00:04:06.781 --> 00:04:08.598
USED TO BE DEMOCRAT THE FLOOD

00:04:08.609 --> 00:04:10.184
OF ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS IS

00:04:10.195 --> 00:04:11.772
DRIVING THEM INTO THE

00:04:11.805 --> 00:04:13.249
REPUBLICAN PARTY AND AS I THINK

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.822
PROFOUNDLY CHANGING THE

00:04:14.856 --> 00:04:16.816
POLITICS OF THE UNITED STATES.

00:04:16.817 --> 00:04:18.522
&gt;&gt; Bill: TOM MCCLINTOCK IS A

00:04:18.533 --> 00:04:19.421
REPUBLICAN FROM CALIFORNIA

00:04:19.432 --> 00:04:20.806
DOING A LOT OF THE QUESTIONING.

00:04:20.839 --> 00:04:21.945
LAST POINT ON THIS.

00:04:21.956 --> 00:04:23.596
HE TOLD US THERE WILL BE NO

00:04:23.597 --> 00:04:26.200
PROGRESS ON THE BORDER AS LONG

00:04:26.235 --> 00:04:27.754
AS THE CURRENT ADMINISTRATION

00:04:27.765 --> 00:04:28.999
IS IN POWER.

00:04:29.033 --> 00:04:31.082
NOW, HE MIGHT BE RIGHT OR A

00:04:31.093 --> 00:04:33.449
MONTH FROM NOW IF YOU SEE

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.004
18,000 PEOPLE A DAY CROSS THE

00:04:37.038 --> 00:04:38.634
BORDER, THAT MAY HAVE AN

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:39.676
IMPACT, THE VISUAL THAT MANY

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.476
WILL SEE.

00:04:40.487 --> 00:04:42.231
WHAT DO YOU THINK ABOUT THAT?

00:04:42.242 --> 00:04:43.605
&gt;&gt; FIRST OF ALL THE REPUBLICANS

00:04:43.639 --> 00:04:45.091
WILL WIN THE HOUSE AND SENATE.

00:04:45.102 --> 00:04:47.806
I THINK ONE OF THE FIRST THINGS

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.582
THEY SHOULD DO IS SEND UP A

00:04:49.593 --> 00:04:50.738
BILL REQUIRING THE COMPLETION

00:04:50.749 --> 00:04:51.974
OF THE WALL AND CONTROL OF THE

00:04:52.008 --> 00:04:52.686
BORDER.

00:04:52.697 --> 00:04:55.927
IT WILL BE WILDLY POPULAR WITH

00:04:55.961 --> 00:04:56.716
THE COUNTRY.

00:04:56.727 --> 00:04:57.662
70% PLUS SUPPORT.

00:04:57.673 --> 00:04:59.702
AND PUT IT TO BIDEN AND PUT IT

00:04:59.703 --> 00:05:00.703
TO THE HOUSE AND SENATE

00:05:00.704 --> 00:05:01.132
DEMOCRATS.

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:02.675
YOU WANT TO VOTE AGAINST

00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:03.860
CONTROLLING THE BORDER?

00:05:03.861 --> 00:05:05.806
YOU WANT TO VOTE TO CONTINUE TO

00:05:05.817 --> 00:05:07.124
ALLOW MILLIONS OF ILLEGAL

00:05:07.157 --> 00:05:08.435
IMMIGRANTS TO COME IN?

00:05:08.446 --> 00:05:09.636
THIS IS ALL GOING TO KEEP

00:05:09.647 --> 00:05:10.207
GROWING.

00:05:10.218 --> 00:05:14.188
THE FACT IS WHEN YOU HAVE THE

00:05:14.199 --> 00:05:15.401
GOVERNOR OF CALIFORNIA

00:05:15.412 --> 00:05:16.473
PROMISING FREE HEALTHCARE TO

00:05:16.484 --> 00:05:18.936
ANYBODY ILLEGAL WHO COMES INTO

00:05:18.947 --> 00:05:21.684
THE U.S. WE SEND A SIGNAL.

00:05:21.685 --> 00:05:23.748
150 COUNTRIES NOW THAT HAVE

00:05:23.759 --> 00:05:25.066
SENT ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS TO THE

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:25.598
UNITED STATES.

00:05:25.609 --> 00:05:26.701
150 COUNTRIES.

00:05:26.712 --> 00:05:28.738
THIS IS JUST GOING TO GET

00:05:28.749 --> 00:05:30.708
STEADILY WORSE AND I THINK IT

00:05:30.719 --> 00:05:32.564
COULD BE IN JANUARY ONE OF THE

00:05:32.575 --> 00:05:34.117
FIRST REALLY BIG FIGHTS BETWEEN

00:05:34.128 --> 00:05:35.136
THE NEW REPUBLICAN CONGRESS AND

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.094
THE PRESIDENT.

00:05:36.105 --> 00:05:38.952
AND I THINK HE WILL HAVE A HARD

00:05:38.963 --> 00:05:40.223
TIME SUSTAINING A VETO.

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:40.850
&gt;&gt; Dana: INTERESTING.

00:05:40.861 --> 00:05:41.872
THANK YOU, MR. SPEAKER.

00:05:41.873 --> 00:05:42.045
GOOD TO SEE YOU.

